{"Title":"An Act clarifying the vehicle transfer and registration laws","BillNumber":"H3422","DocketNumber":"HD1409","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJS1","Name":"Adam J. Scanlon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T13:30:31.973"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJS1","Name":"Adam J. Scanlon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T13:30:31.9733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3422/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Scanlon of North Attleborough, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3422) of Adam Scanlon relative to clarifying vehicle transfer and registration laws.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 2 of chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 134, the words \"five o'clock post meridian of the seventh calendar day\" and inserting in place thereof the following words:-\r\n\t\"the close of business of the tenth business day\"\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 4 of chapter 90D of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 4, the words “within ten days from the” and inserting in place thereof the following words:-\r\n\t“prior to the close of business of the tenth business day following the”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}